# The staged context is allowlisted again before the image build receives it.
**
!Dockerfile
!hub.config.py
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!CHANGELOG.md
# Podman reads files only inside re-included folders, so re-include the source
# folders, drop every file with an extension, then take back the Python sources.
!src/**/
src/**/*.*
!src/robozium/**/*.py
**/.env*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
